flowchart LR
    Client[Authorized test client]
    Operator[Authorized recovery operator]
    subgraph ERP[ERP service process]
        API[Submission and status API]
        Worker[Outbox delivery worker]
        Recovery[Recovery authorization and audit]
    end
    subgraph EDB[ERP SQL database]
        Orders[(Source orders)]
        Outbox[(Outbox and attempt history)]
    end
    subgraph WMS[WMS service process]
        Auth[Authentication and source authorization]
        Accept[Validation and idempotent acceptance]
    end
    subgraph WDB[WMS SQL database]
        Receipt[(Acceptance receipt)]
        Work[(Accepted warehouse orders)]
    end
    Client -->|Create order / query status| API
    API -->|One local transaction| Orders
    API -->|Same local transaction| Outbox
    Outbox -->|Read due records| Worker
    Worker -->|HTTP POST with stable identity| Auth
    Auth --> Accept
    Accept -->|One local transaction| Receipt
    Accept -->|Same local transaction| Work
    Accept -->|Stored acceptance outcome| Worker
    Worker -->|Persist outcome and attempt| Outbox
    Operator --> Recovery
    Recovery -->|Requeue original identity / preserve history| Outbox
    Runner[Isolated fault runner and independent assertions]
    Runner -.->|Submit synthetic orders / inject faults| Client
    Runner -.->|Inspect test state only| EDB
    Runner -.->|Inspect test state only| WDB
